          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              The first clause in Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#BireflectiveSubcategory"}
              does not in general by itself enforce the second clause. A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/counter-example"} counter-example
              is given in
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#FOPTST99"} FOPTST99, Rem. 12
            %p
              However, the second clause does follow automatically when
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℬ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{B}
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy-complete+category"} Cauchy-complete category
              (
              %a{:href => "#JS96"}> Johnstone (1996)
              ).
          %p
          .num_remark
