            we recover the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frobenius+monad"} Frobenius monad
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo ♮
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \natural
            as follows:
          %p
          .num_lemma
            %h6 Lemma
            %p
              Given a split idempotent transformation as in Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#BireflectionsInCCorrespondToSplitIdempotentsOnIdC"}
              we have for all
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                    %mo ∈
                    %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                    %mi ℬ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E \,\in\, \mathcal{B}
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ♮
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msubsup
                      %mi η
                      %mi E
                      %mo ♮
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mo =
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %msubsup
                      %mi η
                      %mrow
                        %mo ♮
                        %mi E
                      %mo ♮
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
