          %h2#references References
          %p
            Subcategories whose inclusion functor admits both a left and right adjoint are called
            %strong bireflective
            in:
          %ul
            %li W. John Wilbur, “Reflective and coreflective hulls in the category of locally convex spaces.” General topology and its applications 4.3 (1974): 235-254.
          %p
            On subcategory inclusions with ambidextrous adjoints (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quintessential+localizations"}> quintessential localizations
            ):
          %ul
            %li#JS96
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Johnstone"}> Peter Johnstone
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Remarks on Quintessential and Persistent Localizations
              %strong 2
              8 (1996) 90-99. &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/1996/n8/n8.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/1996/n8/2-08abs.html"} 2-08
          %p
            On subcategory inclusions with ambidextrous adjoints whose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/points-to-pieces+transform"} points-to-pieces transform
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity"} identity
            (actual
            = succeed "):" do
              %em bireflective subcategories
          %ul
            %li#FOPTST99
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Freyd"}> Peter Freyd
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+O%E2%80%99Hearn"} Peter O’Hearn
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+John+Power"} A. John Power
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M.+Takeyama"} M. Takeyama
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"} Ross Street
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+D.+Tennent"} Robert D. Tennent
              = succeed "," do
                %em Bireflectivity
              %strong 228
              1–2 (1999) 49-76 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0304-3975(98)00354-5"}> doi:10.1016/S0304-3975(98)00354-5
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
